sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant C as OrgController
    participant S as OrgService
    participant R as OrgRepository

    U->>C: POST /api/v1/organizations
    C->>S: createOrganization(request)
    S->>S: verify users.status=ACTIVE
    S->>R: insert organizations(status=PENDING_REVIEW)
    R-->>S: organization
    S-->>C: response DTO
    C-->>U: envelope(success,data,error)
